    {
      "id": "47b72ab9-fa03-4e15-83bb-39c8faad7a3b",
      "name": "Ingress Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1900,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## Webhook Ingress\n\nMechanics only; names come from the config key. The webhook secret is read from the configured Redis key at request time and is never stored in this workflow.\n\nVerify the HMAC signature of the raw body (401 on mismatch, fail-closed when the secret is unset). Normalize the GitHub payload into the intake envelope. Admit only configured events; bot actors are admitted for opened/reopened/closed only so the pipeline's own label edits cannot loop.\n\nRouting after admission, in order: a merged pull request on a pipeline branch labels its issue shipped; review feedback from a configured approver on a pipeline PR becomes a feedback item on the intake queue (stage feedback, targeting the issue; the sorter sends it straight to the build queue); an approving review by an approver calls the merger immediately; everything else is pushed to the intake queue in the poller's item shape."
      }
    },
